{"c":[{"name":"20260919T180843Z-c0da2dfb3d09eb5e","text":"Mac CI on main is macos-26 for glassEffect/Xcode 26. Do not move that job back to macos-15 default Xcode 16.4.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T181107Z-8c8e5b028a0a7d1d","text":"Screenpipe 0.4.50 stores no clipboard history by default; enable with --disable-clipboard-capture false. Caret pin launch does not pass that flag.","type":"note"}]}
